<title>AUSTRIA: Creditanstalt Q1 oper profit up.</title>
<headline>Creditanstalt Q1 oper profit up.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creditanstalt-Bankverein said on Wednesday group operating profit in the first quarter of 1997 rose to 2.2 billion schillings from 1.61 billion the previous year and forecast an increase in full-year net.</p>
<p>In a statement Creditanstalt traced the jump in first quarter earnings to a strong trading result.</p>
</text>
